X-SOURCE:Meetup: Tech Lancaster
UID:event_313614670@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260420T032738Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T203000
SUMMARY:Tech Lancaster Meetup
DESCRIPTION:Tech Lancaster Meetups\nWe will be upstairs in "The Sanctuary"
  - when you walk in the main entrance just head up the stairs! We will hav
 e signs as you walk in to guide you.\nPizza is provided free upstairs. Bee
 r/wine/soda/etc at the bar downstairs!\n\nThis months speakers:\n**Tom Cou
 rtney - *The AI-Powered Maker: Designing\, Debugging\, and Building a Mine
 craft TNT Game ***\nLearn how AI helped conceptualize\, design\, debug\, a
 nd build a 3D-printed Minecraft TNT game. Learn practical workflows for br
 idging software logic and 3D print design with hardware like the ESP32-C3\
 , RFID\, and tilt sensors.\n\n**Caleb Bornman - *Meshtastic and MeshCore: 
 Exploring Low Power mesh radio ***\nExploring the intersection of open-sou
 rce protocols and cheap LoRa hardware. Stay connected to your friends or f
 amily without power or internet\, whether it’s in the woods\, in a bustl
 ing city\, or a busy concert.\n\nTypical schedule of events:\n\n6:30 PM Do
 ors Open/Pizza/Mingle\n\n7:00 PM Introduction/Announcements\n\n7:05 PM Fir
 st Speaker\n\n7:35 PM Break\n\n7:45 PM Speaker 2\n\n8:15 PM End
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/tech-lancaster-meetups/events/3136146
 70/
